:"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34538","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c116187","characterName":"エリエル先生","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c116187"},"originalCharacterName":"エリエル先生","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mirror world inhabitant who looks exactly like Suzuki Eri. The teacher of two little witches."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first glance, she seems like a strict dominatrix, but she's actually a pretty laid-back teacher. She's hedonistic and promiscuous, but deep down, she's a good person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"For now, let's call this a field trip, shall we?♪ I think I'll enjoy this world over here, won't I?♪\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As the teacher of the little witches, she came to bring Kuru back, but she starts enjoying the real world she hasn't visited in ages."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special Note: Breast Size"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"So large you'll want to beg, “Use those breasts to slap my face, squeeze me, suffocate me!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From archived official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c116187"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f36c27ce08750511913c08931404f3a9247de85e8e39fa34a3fab9a4d5311d1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9599db9de7cd095e91c9de9f959707039463abd06183f88114449c3b381457f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木葉 楓","creatorId":"vndb:s471","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s471","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s471","name":"力丸 乃りこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","r