e, she's a little lamb who wonders if he truly likes her back. Could the aggressive advances from classmate Banjou-kun be part of the reason?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she was little, she referred to herself as “Boku” (a masculine pronoun). When sulking or embarrassed, her pronoun shifts to ‘Boku’ and she becomes a “I-am-a-star-person.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special Note: Breast Size"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Large and soft enough to make one want to fulfill their first love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From archived official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84335"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67d63625118ee90bd911f3214f4b7db94a028e7f85f78ef9703518a342b31ce0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76884ea89cd7a9caa3854d235c1a2a09bf34c29727d16e7e860bc54816d04cd6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"成瀬 未亜","creatorId":"vndb:s470","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s470","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s470","name":"成瀬 未亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34541","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c84336","characterName":"湊 みらい","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c84336"},"originalCharacterName":"湊 みらい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Alto's other childhood friend. A second-year student at Saint Mirowa Academy. Her devilish words and actions have tormented Alt since childhood. She has an elusive, kitten-like personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She actually has a slight crush on Alto, but he's too easygoing for her to recognize it as romance. Teasing him is her current happiness. When she was little, she called herself “Jibun.” When sulking or embarrassed, her first-person pronoun switches to “Jibun.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special Note: Breast Size"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"So small you might think, “Should I knead them to make them bigger!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"as payback for her teasing. (Note: Compared to Ru-cha!)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From archived official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84336"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/290b4786753852eefdd389363a191fcd717287756661b5255d9c0ca237977eac.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4e2081f54a2b8221d1181961173373e650af38483921c36ab4bf52d0ae73fa1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桃華ちゃん","creatorId":"vndb:s25","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25","name":"安田 未央","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34537","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c84337","characterName":"鈴木 エリ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c84337"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴木 エリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"26"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Alto-kun's older sister. Teacher at Saint Mirowa Academy. 26 years old. She's easygoing, kind, and dependable, but also a bit slow-paced and airheaded. The big sister who's watched over the trio of childhood friends: Alto, Kurumi, and Mirai."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She speaks formally even to her much younger brother, Alto-kun. A soothing older sister who'd rank high on any list of ideal marriage candidates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though kind-hearted, when she gets angry, she says harsh things with a smile and in her usual tone—which can be scary or make your heart flutter... Since her parents are overseas, she acts as a surrogate parent to Alto-kun."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special Note: Breast Size"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"So big you'd want to suckle after shouting, “Blood ties don't matter, Eri-nee!!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From archived official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c84337"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e19cbfbddd1a6bcd59f8ed36b1f56852c956cb3536b4004a2cefa584f846482.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/59f8a8204092d16f80548fe969aae583497d957436bd6b7b886da56cb45e2f53.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木葉 楓","creatorId":"vndb:s471","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s471","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s471","name":"力丸 乃りこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34543","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:1020","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1020","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:1020","name":"るチャ!(LUCHA!)","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-brand:3351:1020","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p785","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p785","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p785","name":"LUCHA!","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:14115:v6080","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
